<title>USA: Millburn, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>Millburn, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $4.850 million of Millburn, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.60, highest price of 100.0058.</p>
